# 이미지 맞춤 표시(빠른 확인): 이미지를 열어 시간을 두고 여러 번 캡처한다. 실행 이름은 image-jpg-quick이다.
waittabs 1 @30000
waitstate cwd=C: @30000
send echo READY-JPG\r
waitline READY-JPG @30000
wait 3000
act openpath C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-image-jpg-quick/proj-big/img/b.jpg
waitstate kind=image state=image size=640x480 @10000
wait 300
shot j1
wait 1500
shot j2
act openpath C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-image-jpg-quick/proj-big/img/a.png
waitstate kind=image state=image size=320x200 @10000
wait 800
shot j3
wait 3000
shot j4
act imgzoom
wait 1000
act imgzoom
wait 1000
shot j5
quit
